1
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,520
This is

2
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,320
Mala's story.

3
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:47,920
It's ruined.

4
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,920
I can't write anymore.

5
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:53,250
Do you think we should write Mala's story,

6
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,560
and use his death

7
00:01:56,039 --> 00:01:56,880
as material?

8
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,300
Let's not write it.

9
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:07,650
There are many other stories in this world that can be written into novels.

10
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,440
Let him

11
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,800
stay in our hearts forever.

12
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,760
Did you plan

13
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,840
everything tonight?

14
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,120
His ending

15
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:11,050
is already waiting for him.

16
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:12,720
No one can stop it.

17
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:18,000
So you were acting all along

18
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,800
just to kill him?

19
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,840
I'm not that capable.

20
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:23,720
I just completed

21
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:25,840
my part of the puzzle.

22
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,420
It wasn't until I found out

23
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:31,360
that Zhiwei's safe password

24
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,360
was set to your birthday

25
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,570
that I accelerated the plan

26
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,900
and guided the so-called helmet man.

27
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:40,280
To complete the part he needs to complete.

28
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,040
So,

29
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,680
you've already experienced

30
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,480
everything that happened to us.

31
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:49,090
I'm just respecting the rules of time.

32
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:51,840
There is only one timeline in the universe.

33
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,160
I succeeded

34
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:56,000
because I was originally a part of his plan.

35
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:58,000
According to you,

36
00:03:58,320 --> 00:04:00,120
when twelve o'clock comes,

37
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:02,960
no amount of effort can change his death.

38
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,840
He had countless chances.

39
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:08,280
It's just because of his choices

40
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:10,760
that he ended up where he is today.

41
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,000
I will make sure everything

42
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,860
continues on its original track.

43
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,720
Who exactly is he?

44
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,560
Is it really Mala?

45
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,800
I'm going to find him.

46
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,560
Hear me out.

47
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,400
Leave the rest to me.

48
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,720
You leave here clean.

49
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:34,040
I will get the justice we deserve.

50
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,400
I'll make him pay the price

51
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,090
for everything he has done.

52
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:06,440
It's you.

53
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,040
What are you laughing at?

54
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,880
I paid the price I deserved.

55
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,200
So did you.

56
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,320
Impossible.

57
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,780
I saw Xiaotao die with my own eyes.

58
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,600
I even saw it twice.

59
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,960
Actually, in this house,

60
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,800
the helmeted figures that appeared,

61
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,060
there were two of them.

62
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,280
The first one was Zhiwei.

63
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,480
After Xiaotao fell from the building,

64
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:16,410
it was Zhiwei who dragged him away.

65
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,920
The one who locked me in the bathroom

66
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,120
was also Zhiwei.

67
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,960
There was another helmeted figure.

68
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,880
It was Xiaotao.

69
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,520
I didn't mean it,

70
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:46,409
Xiaotao.

71
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:54,080
Xiaotao is the author of the first draft of "The Death of Marat".

72
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:57,140
So he also knows the secret of overlapping time travel.

73
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,120
Actually, I've talked to Mr. Dai.

74
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:07,880
You said

75
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,960
my name could be added to the credits.

76
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,090
I'm sorry, Xiaotao.

77
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:15,400
The published books have already been printed.

78
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:17,040
The original contract has also been signed.

79
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,040
The awards ceremony is tomorrow.

80
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,520
Adding someone now would be a breach of contract.

81
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:20,560
We would have to withdraw from the competition.

82
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,290
It was Zhiwei

83
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,220
who took all the credit

84
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,240
for their shared success.

85
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:28,570
That gave me the opportunity to turn Xiaotao.

86
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:32,490
I had Xiaotao disguise himself as Mala

87
00:07:32,640 --> 00:07:35,159
and destroy the only transport out of here.

88
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,280
I also led Xiaotao

89
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:49,690
to discover that his name wasn't in the contract.

90
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,760
I admit I didn't intend to include your name.

91
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:04,880
You finally spoke your mind.

92
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:08,520
I always treated you like a brother.

93
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,520
Xiaotao.

94
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,000
Xiaotao.

95
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:25,720
Let me introduce you.

96
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:26,900
This is Sophie,

97
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,680
a rising star in showbiz.

98
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:31,600
Get her autograph later.

99
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:33,330
She will definitely be famous.

100
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:34,340
Mr. Dai,

101
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,280
I'll let you guys talk.

102
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:35,679
I'm coming, bro.

103
00:08:35,679 --> 00:08:37,679
We'll head down the mountain first.

104
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:49,800
Everyone

105
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:52,200
must pay the price

106
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,560
for their choices.

107
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,360
I'm just going with the flow.

108
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:58,080
What a terrifying woman.

109
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:03,200
I didn't expect to hear that from you.

110
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,920
But why are you trying to persuade me to leave with you?

111
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:09,840
Haven't you always disliked me?

112
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:10,800
Could it be

113
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:12,240
just my imagination?

114
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,200
All along,

115
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,780
you've been the one who hated me more, right?

116
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,300
Since we were kids,

117
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:21,890
whatever I learned,

118
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:23,840
you had to learn too.

119
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:25,800
Sometimes,

120
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:27,460
you even did it better than me.

121
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:30,600
I could only pretend not to care

122
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,440
and just give up.

123
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:35,040
Isn't that infuriating?

124
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,560
Yeah.

125
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,240
I'm really infuriating.

126
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:44,800
So infuriating that it took you until today to acknowledge me

127
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:46,720
and open up to me.

128
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:52,720
I know

129
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,880
when you started

130
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,460
being hostile towards me.

131
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:03,960
Don't cry.

132
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:08,080
You hate me because when you were most helpless,

133
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,160
I left you.

134
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:13,760
Later,

135
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:17,740
I secretly used many methods you didn't even know about

136
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:21,420
to make sure he could never appear in front of you again.

137
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,560
So this time,

138
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:33,480
I won't leave you alone.

139
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,160
Why?

140
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,280
Actually,

141
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:42,080
the difference between enemies and friends

142
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,920
is not how close they are,

143
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:45,360
but whether

144
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,560
they share a secret.

145
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:49,800
Besides,

146
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,280
Besides what?

147
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,200
You're my aunt.
